/-!
# A322168

Sequence gives the values of the trace A+D of the 2 X 2 matrices [[A,B],[C,D]] in a binary tree of the special linear monoid, SL(2,Z+).

The 127 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A322168

